            "review_title": "Review at Ebisu Udon & Sushi",
            "review_text": "Emma-Angèle\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam117 contributions\n0\nBEST UDON NODDLES IN HO CHI MINH CITY\nSep 2024 • Friends\nMy favorite restaurant to eat Udon noodles! \n\nVery good portion, impossible to leave the restaurant without being full 😋\n\nCongratulations to all the team, the service for your kindness and welcome, but also the kitchen staff who make us the best Udon Noodles in town 😋😋\n\nAddress saved in my favorites for a long time! \n\nThank you! I recommend +++ ❤️❤️\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten September 5, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
