            "review_title": "Review at Ebisu Udon & Sushi",
            "review_text": "William W\nMount Isa, Australia85 contributions\n2\nAuthentic Japanese food\nOct 2018 • Solo\nThe kind of eatery where people eat and then leave. Not a place for a meeting or an intimate dinner. Regardless I noticed a lot of Japanese people here so I surmise it is good by their standards. The Menu is not extensive but my Granny always said that a restaurant is better if the specialize with limited dishes and not try to 'do it all'. I greatly enjoyed the experience and it was not expensive although the food was upmarket.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 12, 2018",
